{
  "name": "Day 20 — Nightly Workflow Backup → GitHub",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 20: Nightly Workflow Backup → GitHub\n\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect: n8n API key (Settings → n8n API)\n- Connect: GitHub (personal access token)\n- GitHub par private repo \"n8n-backups\" banao\n- n8n Settings → n8n API → API key banao; credential mein Base URL = https://your-n8n-domain/api/v1\n- GitHub token mein \"Contents: read & write\" permission do\n\nCourse: Day 20 lesson page",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "82050e14-c893-4e03-a962-3b0e7939ce7b",
      "name": "Setup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1aa84837-cf53-4989-a1f3-7bcd9a4a7aa4",
      "name": "Every Night 2 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {},
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "900f3f86-e482-4a22-a2de-c20fe453f15e",
      "name": "Get All Workflows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.n8n",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        260,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const day = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\nreturn $input.all().map(({ json: wf }) => {\n  const safe = wf.name.replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/gi, '-').toLowerCase();\n  return { json: {\n    path: 'backups/' + day + '/' + safe + '-' + wf.id + '.json',\n    content: JSON.stringify(wf, null, 2),\n    message: 'Backup ' + wf.name + ' (' + day + ')'\n  } };\n});"
      },
      "id": "a2ec4971-1979-4c1c-a5e5-1643d73e3515",
      "name": "Prepare Files",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "file",
        "operation": "create",
        "owner": "YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME",
        "repository": "n8n-backups",
        "filePath": "={{ $json.path }}",
        "fileContent": "={{ $json.content }}",
        "commitMessage": "={{ $json.message }}"
      },
      "id": "b706a3c0-99fd-4e66-ab24-59e81d787387",
      "name": "Commit to GitHub",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.github",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Night 2 AM": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get All Workflows",
